#DEFAULT_NONVOLATILE
#ENABLE_STACK_CHECKING

#HELP_BEGIN
	This module shows current day of week.
	
	Pulse the update input to get the day of the week value. Outputs stay high until an update 
	is requested.

#HELP_END


